{"id":"a295446296ee06c0","group":"91","path":"91/91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md","title":"完整 KF 的基础反射与 PA 一致性","display":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 完整 KF 的基础反射与 PA 一致性","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency","aliases":["91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency"],"display":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 完整 KF 的基础反射与 PA 一致性","depends_on":["[[91-df-KF]]","[[91-df-CT]]","[[91-df-global-reflection]]","[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","[[91-df-induction-schema]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency — 完整 KF 的基础反射与 PA 一致性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a0a2284f96eaea1d\" href=\"?note=a0a2284f96eaea1d\" title=\"91-df-KF\">91-df-KF</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4e1e503ea918b41a\" href=\"?note=4e1e503ea918b41a\" title=\"91-df-CT\">91-df-CT</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16b107dfee99998b\" href=\"?note=16b107dfee99998b\" title=\"91-df-global-reflection\">91-df-global-reflection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e50c115b0d32044\" href=\"?note=4e50c115b0d32044\" title=\"91-df-consistency-predicate\">91-df-consistency-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"09791de618b277ba\" href=\"?note=09791de618b277ba\" title=\"91-df-induction-schema\">91-df-induction-schema</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CT}\">\\(\\mathrm{CT}\\)</span> 为原书完整归纳版本；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_0(a)\">\\(D_0(a)\\)</span> 为基础句子守卫，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\">\\(\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})\\)</span> 使用通常 PA 证明谓词。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot=(0=1)\">\\(\\bot=(0=1)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先在 KF 内对基础公式的逻辑复杂度归纳：原子等式由 KF1/KF2 得完整且一致的真/假信息；双否定、正反合取/析取和正反量词子句把这个性质传给所有基础代码。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a(D_0(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)])\">\\(\\forall a(D_0(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)])\\)</span> 可证，六个基础 CT 组合句在 KF 中可导出，其完整归纳也已包含。\n于是将 CT 的 Theorem 8.32 证明移入 KF，得到 PA 全局反射；KF1 又直接给 ¬T(⌜0=1⌝)。反射的矛盾实例即 Con(PA)。只对基础代码恢复完整否定，不会给整个 T 语言 CT 式否定。\n原书 §15.3 的分层真理下界也支持此一致性后果。上述基础 CT 归约是目录为此节点补出的具体证明路线，未声称书中有同名独立定理。结论不排除第二不完备定理：KF 证明的是较弱 PA 的一致性。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 8.32、Corollary 8.33，印刷页 90–93；§8.7 的正组合恢复经典否定；Definition 15.2 与 §15.3。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-KF","status":"resolved","id":"a0a2284f96eaea1d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-KF]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-CT","status":"resolved","id":"4e1e503ea918b41a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-CT]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-global-reflection","status":"resolved","id":"16b107dfee99998b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-global-reflection]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-consistency-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"4e50c115b0d32044","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-consistency-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-induction-schema","status":"resolved","id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-induction-schema]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{KF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CT}","display":false},{"tex":"D_0(a)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA})","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot=(0=1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA})=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_{\\mathrm{PA}}(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}KF\\text{-}proves\\text{-}PA\\text{-}consistency}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\mathrm{GRF}_T(\\mathrm{PA}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner0=1\\urcorner}),\\qquad\n\\mathrm{KF}\\vdash\\operatorname{Con}(\\mathrm{PA}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a(D_0(a)\\to[T(\\operatorname{neg}(a))\\leftrightarrow\\neg T(a)])","display":false}],"bytes":2062,"backlinks":[{"id":"5fc33cbab29395e4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e55a4d03b99a537e","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6be0fd6df8f81383","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a57cead6abc35383","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第一行是原书 Lemma 15.4，以矩阵结构归纳及十三条公理证明。第二行由标准 KF 的完整归纳直接包含正公式归纳实例。\n此处不再以未指明的“某个 KF 正归纳版本已证明全局反射”作定理前提；不同弱归纳版本的精确最小强度未由原文件给出，也不是上述结论的推论。标准全归纳 KF 证明 PA 一致性另见 [[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]。"},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-138","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-129","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-thm-CT-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-necessity-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-omega-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-FS-strength.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-minimal-fixed-point-characterization.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-proves-PA-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-KF-soundness.md]]\n[[91-thm-McGee.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-T-schema-partial-recovery.md]]\n[[91-thm-TB-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-Tarski-undefinability.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-KF-equivalence.md]]\n[[91-thm-VF-conservative.md]]\n[[91-thm-compositional-completeness.md]]\n[[91-thm-conservative-extension-axioms.md]]\n[[91-thm-diagonal-lemma.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-existence.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-lattice.md]]\n[[91-thm-fixed-point-non-uniqueness.md]]\n[[91-thm-hierarchical-truth-consistency.md]]\n[[91-thm-iteration-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-kripke-jump-iteration.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-not-provable.md]]\n[[91-thm-liar-sentence-properties.md]]\n[[91-thm-numeral-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-positive-induction-adequacy.md]]\n[[91-thm-reflection-from-truth.md]]\n[[91-thm-revision-convergence.md]]\n[[91-thm-sou